# The Stair of Hours (CIPlay stair_of_hours): a sky island 30 m up; the hours walked (1, 3, 7 - then 12 shows), the
# sundial instructions, Shadow Crag's foot and top, the astronomer's note and the telescope's lens (10-25 deep pass), the
# telescope (the vault opens), the vault's three plans, Halvard's last log.
island The Stair of Hours
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Walking the Hours
zone hour_1
expect step 1
read Sundial instructions
expect step 2
zone hour_3
zone hour_7
zone hour_12
expect step 3
use telescope
expect story sighted 0
zone cragfoot
expect step 4
zone cragtop
expect step 5
read Dr. Lise Holm
expect step 6
open Star station chest
wait 3
expect story lens 1
expect step 7
use telescope
expect story sighted 1
expect step 8
open Telescope vault
wait 3
expect step 11
read Halvard's last log
storespot 0 -18
expect done